Date: Fri, 20 Aug 2021 16:40:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 083/232] add rk3399 hdmi2csi and hdmi2dsi dts demo

Signed-off-by: Luo Wei <lw@rock-chips.com>
Change-Id: I69877c28047a93ea7422a9d3959e81499976b7f0
Signed-off-by: Guochun Huang <hero.huang@rock-chips.com>
