 ...evb-ind-lpddr4-rk628-hdmi2csi-v4l2-avb.dts | 263 ++++++++++++++++++
 ...3399-evb-ind-lpddr4-rk628-hdmi2dsi-avb.dts | 184 ++++++++++++
